      "summary": "Keyence pitches logistics as a single-source portfolio: barcode readers, ST Series scan tunnels, handheld computers such as its new long-range series, plus vision, controls and safety. It targets warehouses, fulfillment and distribution centers, promising fewer no-reads, quick-disconnect cabling for faster commissioning, and traceability from receiving to shipping. It sells direct, with its engineers assessing customer processes on site. Expect a Balluff rep to meet Keyence in distribution centers where code reading and traceability open the door.",
